"""GRT Campus FAQ Assistant - single-file Streamlit app.

Everything is inside this one file (the web app is stored compressed below),
so app.py is the only file you need to upload to GitHub.

Deploy: Streamlit Community Cloud, main file = app.py
Local:  pip install streamlit  then  streamlit run app.py

Recent questions, unanswered questions, feedback, notices and theme are saved
in each visitor's browser (localStorage), so they are private to that browser.
All FAQ answers are sample/placeholder text: replace with verified details.
"""
